            "review_text": "Helen Chau\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam10 contributions\n0\nCozy place for dating\nNov 2025 • Couples\nI recently tried out it nearby the beach, and wow, the ingredients were incredibly fresh and delicious. The steam food really is in the natural taste. The prices were quite reasonable comparing the quality. The restaurant’s design was cozy and modern, not too much fancy but definitely a comfortable. More, it’s convenient place located near the tourist area, so it’s easy to stop if arrive Vung Tau. I absolutely recommend this to u who enjoys healthy, fresh food and a relaxing dining.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nhave chance, should call or contact for booking first, if not we had to wait for long time\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 28, 2025\nJoki Enkai V\nThank you so much for your visiting.\nWritten December 2, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
